{"4097400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "G.A.M.M.A.", "steam_appid": 4097400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a PvP/Co-op extraction shooter for up to 5 players, where you’ll fight both human opponents and mysterious anomaly enemies. Work together or compete to collect valuable items scattered across the map, survive the chaos, and reach the extraction point to progress to the next area. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097400/extras/546efbd61746f90ada1e6a3549b56304.avif?t=1763995381\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097400/extras/66469cd65637e9beed5523d81258c969.webp?t=1763995381\" width=616 height=38 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097400/extras/3060fada0617b1699b3e6be82f2a722d.poster.avif?t=1763995381\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097400/extras/3060fada0617b1699b3e6be82f2a722d.webm?t=1763995381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097400/extras/3060fada0617b1699b3e6be82f2a722d.mp4?t=1763995381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It’s not just other players you should worry about.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map itself wants you gone  good luck outsmarting both. <br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097400/extras